 "text": "Hi, how have you been? That's normal. Start with what you' confident making, and add things as you pack. A big platter of grams, crisps and cheese takes up little space and gives you goals. Under the standing table, or in the shade. A cheap torch and batteries are worth it in the dark. few more minutes would be fine. Serve the food in small bowls, and keep the drinks in boxes. That's enough. Take the car not the bike.",
